1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:55,650
Such abundant spiritual energy !

25
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:57,170
This cave is extraordinary.

26
00:01:58,040 --> 00:02:01,370
The Divine Path is the treasure of our War God Shrine.

27
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:05,250
It can greatly increase a cultivator's success rate in forming a Nascent Soul.

28
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,570
The original Divine Path

29
00:02:06,320 --> 00:02:09,530
was stolen by a high rank cultivation country long ago.

30
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,930
The Divine Path is extremely profound

31
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,610
and almost impossible to memorize

32
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,370
or write down.

33
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:21,450
But Founder Chen Chong, relied on his memory back then

34
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:24,290
to forcibly engrave the Divine Path onto this stone tablet

35
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:27,610
and died of exhaustion by doing it.

36
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:36,290
Disciple Chen Chong is engraving by memory.

37
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:40,930
Future cultivators must be extremely cautious.

38
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:45,050
How can a few thousand characters be hard to write down ?

39
00:02:45,320 --> 00:02:47,330
The Divine Path is unfathomable.

40
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:49,410
See for yourself.

41
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,930
As long as it helps me form my Nascent Soul,

42
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,530
it's worth it.

43
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,210
What's happening !?

44
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:12,210
The Divine Path really can't be memorized !

45
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:16,450
No, it's a restriction that prevents memorization.

46
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:19,610
That's why it's possible to understand but not memorize.

47
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:21,890
Founder Chen Chong actually managed to memorize it by force

48
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,050
and write it down.

49
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:25,930
His perseverance was truly astonishing.

50
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,170
The fiend is in trouble !

51
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:31,410
Isn't this a great opportunity to finish him off ?

52
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,210
I can only use this once !

53
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:37,410
Fellow Corpse Sect disciples,

54
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,290
come save me !

55
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:45,490
Master,

56
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:49,810
Zhao Chuanliang
Burning Fire Alliance's Corpse Sect Leader
Early stage Nascent Soul

57
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:48,170
please give me 10 more days.

58
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:50,530
I will definitely bring Xu Liguo back !

59
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:54,850
Chen Bai
Tian Gang country's Corpse Sect Leader
Early stage Soul Formation

60
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:56,530
If I give you more time, I'm the one that will have to explain them.

61
00:03:56,840 --> 00:04:00,450
Xu Liguo is a disciple of the Tian Gang Sect

62
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:02,370
the leader of the country of Tian Gang.

63
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:04,930
What am I going to tell them ?

64
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,650
Master,

65
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:08,170
Xu Liguo sent a distress signal 2 days ago.

66
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,010
We have already located him.

67
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,970
He was captured by a War God Shrine disciple named Ma Liang.

68
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,290
Just give me some time

69
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,570
and I will bring him back !

70
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,330
For the sake of our relation,

71
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:23,010
I'll give you 10 days.

72
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:26,370
But if you don't have him in 10 days,

73
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:29,650
don't blame me for being ruthless.

74
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,610
The soul lamp is still lit,

75
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,330
it's not too late.

76
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:45,530
Corpse Sect disciples, heed my order !

77
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,370
Ma Liang of the War God Shrine attacked one of us

78
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:51,010
and extracted the soul of our disciple !

79
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:51,930
It's a crime !

80
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:54,730
All Core Formation disciples and above

81
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,610
will follow me to the Burning Fire Alliance

82
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,970
to seek justice !

83
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,570
Understood !

84
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,050
The Divine Path...

85
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,690
So this is the Divine Path...

86
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:42,050
Create an avatar to cultivate simultaneously with the main body

87
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:44,450
and merge the two bodies to form a Nascent Soul.

88
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,930
Of course it would increase the success chance.

89
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:50,810
But I don't even have enough artifacts and pills to cultivate my main body.

90
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:53,090
How could I possibly cultivate an avatar ?

91
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:55,690
I probably can't follow that path.

92
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:12,530
Chong

93
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,690
Founder Chen Chong,

94
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,690
esteemed Ancestors of the War God Shrine,

95
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:22,850
thank you for your guidance and kindness.

96
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,970
My matters with the War God Shrine are settled.

97
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,490
Next up is...

98
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:40,090
Senior.

99
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:43,410
If you took more time to come out,

100
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,450
I would've come in to find you.

101
00:06:56,280 --> 00:06:58,090
I pray to heaven and earth !

102
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,410
Please come and find me...

103
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:02,570
If they don't come now,

104
00:07:02,320 --> 00:07:05,770
I'll never escape these two devils !

105
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,250
What are you doing ?

106
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,490
N-Nothing, nothing !

107
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:14,250
I was praying for Master's long life.

108
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,570
They're really here.

109
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:59,810
My saviors ! You've finally come to save me !

110
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:02,090
Ma Liang,

111
00:08:02,640 --> 00:08:04,650
do you know what crime you commited ?

112
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:05,570
I don't.

113
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:09,530
Of course you don't !

114
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:28,130
Corpse Sect...

115
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:31,370
You half-human half-ghost freaks,

116
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,210
what are you here for ?

117
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:39,050
Senior, Ma Liang killed a disciple of the Corpse Sect

118
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,770
and extracted the soul of Xu Liguo.

119
00:08:42,040 --> 00:08:44,690
I will now take Ma Liang away

120
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,770
to punish him.

121
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,370
Did you really do it ?

122
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,450
They're framing me.

123
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,850
It's bullshit !

124
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,970
You're the one framing me !

125
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,850
You're the one bullshitting !

126
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,650
Then let us pass.

127
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:59,730
I'm in a hurry.

128
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,650
Senior's cultivation is profound

129
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,690
but making an enemy of the Corpse Sect

130
00:09:12,440 --> 00:09:14,370
is not wise.

131
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:17,090
The Corpse Sect is the largest sect in the Burning Fire Alliance !

132
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:20,050
There are 8 Nascent Soul cultivators here today.

133
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,970
Think carefully.

134
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:25,130
Are you sure you want to protect this brat ?

135
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:28,410
Are you threatening me ?

136
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:30,930
Scram !

137
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:34,330
I don't feel like killing today.

138
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,930
Arrogant !

139
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:57,210
Underworld Mystic Ice Formation !

140
00:09:57,720 --> 00:09:58,530
Fall !

141
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,530
They're doing it !

142
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:05,930
You little fiend, you'll finally be punished !

143
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:08,210
Grandpa Xu is going to be free !

144
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:23,370
I have some ties with your sect.

145
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:27,010
I originally didn't want to offend the Corpse Sect

146
00:10:26,760 --> 00:10:28,410
but...

147
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:31,850
I, the Eight Extremes Devil Lord, haven't killed for a long time...

148
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,450
A few Early stage Nascent Soul cultivators

149
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:38,210
dare to act recklessly before me !?

150
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,450
A Soul Formation cultivator !

151
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:51,770
Quick, activate the teleportation formation !

152
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:13,730
This...

153
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:15,810
is the power of Soul Formation...

154
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:17,370
Now scram.

155
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:21,130
Nascent Soul brats, I won't kill you

156
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:23,850
to give some face to the Corpse Sect.

157
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,490
Ma Liang !

158
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,770
Impossible ! Impossible !

159
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:36,530
How could this have happened ?

160
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:39,170
You little fiend !

161
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,090
No, Master !

162
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:47,330
Let me explain.

163
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:49,810
I was momentarily possessed.

164
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:53,570
It was my fault, I'm terribly sorry...

165
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:56,210
What other methods do you have to contact the Corpse Sect ?

166
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,770
Use them all now.

167
00:11:58,400 --> 00:12:00,730
He actually knew all along...

168
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,530
No way...

169
00:12:02,440 --> 00:12:05,130
He let me do it on purpose !

170
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,130
Little guy,

171
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:17,090
this is the second time I've helped you.

172
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:21,290
No matter what misunderstanding we have, we're even now.

173
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,930
I advise you stay put now.

174
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:27,210
You cannot escape

175
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:29,170
before me.

176
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:32,370
Junior wouldn't dare.

177
00:12:33,800 --> 00:12:36,730
This kid deliberately lured the Corpse Sect here

178
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:39,730
to use me to eliminate them

179
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:42,010
or to try to escape in the chaos.

180
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:44,290
He's bold

181
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:45,570
and very cunning.

182
00:12:45,800 --> 00:12:48,330
He has good potential for a demonic cultivation.

183
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:51,890
If I could take him as a disciple...

184
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,810
Too bad...

185
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:58,410
I can't let him return alive from that place.

186
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:07,610
Chaotic Broken Stars
Sea of Devils

187
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:12,770
This is the Chaotic Broken Stars.

188
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:18,410
To enter the place we're going to

189
00:13:18,520 --> 00:13:20,850
we need to use this ancient teleportation formation.

190
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:23,810
We found this place with some friends

191
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:26,130
after looking through ancient records.

192
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:28,770
It nearly took 1000 years.

193
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,730
The Chaotic Broken Stars

194
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:35,290
is already such a weird place.

195
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,130
Where does the formation lead to ?

196
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:45,770
It's a passage connected to the corpse of an Ancient God.

197
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:47,810
An Ancient God ?

198
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:51,810
They're beings from ancient times comparable to Ancient Immortals.

199
00:13:51,560 --> 00:13:55,810
Their power reached an unimaginable level.

200
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:57,690
Gun Lan
Ancient Emperor
Early stage Soul Formation

201
00:13:56,440 --> 00:14:00,130
It's normal for a Core Formation brat to be unaware.

202
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:05,530
This person, Ancient Emperor, looks righteous

203
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:07,810
but has actually slaughtered countless cities.

204
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:10,610
He's a famous Devil Lord of the Sea of Devils.

205
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,610
Ancient Emperor,

206
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:38,530
this Junior is crucial for passing the third trial.

207
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:40,050
Don't act recklessly.

208
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:40,610
Oh ?

209
00:14:41,280 --> 00:14:42,490
Are you sure ?

210
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:44,730
I also want to know

211
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:48,770
why you're bringing a Core Formation brat to the Land of the Ancient God.

212
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:51,050
What's the meaning of this farce ?

213
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:53,570
Six Desires Devil Lord,

214
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:56,250
one of the 7 Devil Lords of the inner Sea of Devils.

215
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:59,570
He can manipulate people's minds with desires

216
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:00,530
Six Desires Devil Lord
Xuan Tian Sect Leader
Middle stage Soul Formation

217
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:02,890
and has refined countless living puppets.

218
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:06,490
He knows the Death Spell.

219
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:09,890
Little brat,

220
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:13,170
if you can really help us in the third trial,

221
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:17,210
I wouldn't mind keeping you by my side forever.

222
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:19,010
Thank you Senior for your kindness.

223
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,210
Only Hunchback Meng is missing.

224
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:28,890
He was being pursued by the Giant Demon Clan. I wonder if he died.

225
00:15:30,160 --> 00:15:32,130
Even if I were to die,

226
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:34,690
I would've dragged the Giant Demon Clan down with me !

227
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:51,570
You said this little brat knows the Death Spell ?

228
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:57,930
Meng Qingfan
Hunchback Meng
Poison Devil City Lord
Middle stage Soul Formation

229
00:15:57,040 --> 00:15:59,410
Good ! Very good !

230
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:01,770
I wonder what effect it would have

231
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:03,930
if Li Tian devoured him...

232
00:16:03,680 --> 00:16:07,810
It seems most of the Devil Lords of the Sea of Devils have come to this trip.

233
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:09,370
Everyone is here,

234
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,650
let's begin.

235
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:16,730
Take out your top-quality spirit stones.

236
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:20,330
Top-quality spirit stones ?

237
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:25,050
Top-quality spirit stones are very rare on planet Suzaku.

238
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:29,810
It's no wonder a Core Formation brat like you never saw one before.

239
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:31,370
As agreed,

240
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:33,810
I will provide 4 spirit stones this time.

241
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,570
Damn formation,

242
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:39,450
for devouring my 4 top-quality spirit stones.

243
00:17:18,300 --> 00:19:40,610
It might not be clear why the Corpse Sect would go to such lengths to save Xu Liguo. Xu Liguo comes from a rank 4 country and belonged to the sect that controls that country. He had lost his body so his sect bought a new body for him through the Corpse Sect. Since he should've possessed the body by now, the customer (Xu Liguo's sect) is asking for what they paid for. The desperate attack of the Corpse Sect is just a tentative to not lose face and keep its reputation.

The Six Desires Devil Lord is named after the six desires and seven emotions found in The Book of Rites and The Spring and Autumn Annals (ancient chinese texts). There are multiple other variations of these two concept but I'll focus on what's used in Renegade Immortal.

The six desires are lust, greed, vanity, pleasant sounds, having a good life / death, sensual pleasures (pleasures related to the 5 senses: hearing / touch / sight / smell / taste).

The seven emotions are joy, anger, sorrow, fear, love, hatred and affection.

In Renegade Immortal, both the six desires and seven emotions are used interchangeably but will always be named "six desires" which makes it a total of 13 theorical "six desires". For some reason, the first six emotions (excluding affection) are the main "six desires". I don't know why, I hope you're not confused.

It will make sense later why cultivators at Soul Formation are so different from cultivators below that.

244
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:53,970
Count the specks of time

245
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:53,970
floating down gently.

246
00:17:54,080 --> 00:18:00,210
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

247
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:07,730
Forever lock away the scars

248
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:07,730
of this mortal life.

249
00:18:07,740 --> 00:18:14,250
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

250
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:21,970
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

251
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:21,970
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

252
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:29,130
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

253
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:29,130
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

254
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:31,650
I will ask the heavens who exactly

255
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:36,410
sliced open this world

256
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:36,410
to let the rain fall in.

257
00:18:36,160 --> 00:18:38,410
I will refine the world

258
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:40,930
to make our palm lines say

259
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:43,290
that we will live forever.

260
00:18:43,040 --> 00:18:46,210
Walking off the beaten path

261
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:49,290
through heaven and earth.

262
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:56,250
Before returning to dust,

263
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:56,250
I will refine this mortal body.

264
00:18:57,520 --> 00:19:05,130
The left shore is the joyous laughter

265
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:05,130
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

266
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:11,730
The right shore is an eternal silence

267
00:19:06,480 --> 00:19:11,730
lingering under the candlelight.

268
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:14,610
To overturn this fate,

269
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:18,970
I will walk against the heavens.

270
00:19:19,160 --> 00:19:26,130
I will even gather the clouds

271
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:26,130
to illuminate the sky for you.

272
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:30,370
All this sadness was not meaningless.

273
00:19:30,120 --> 00:19:33,690
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

274
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:39,490
I vow to break

275
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:39,490
this chess game of fate.

276
00:19:40,560 --> 00:19:50,450
I vow to break

277
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:50,450
this chess game of fate.
